-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ATTRIBUTION REQUIRED BY THE DATA SOURCE

The annotated facts are derived from DBAASP (Database of Antimicrobial Activity
and Structure of Peptides), whose Data Access Policy permits access, copying,
adaptation and redistribution without restriction but requires that DBAASP be
acknowledged as the source in publications, presentations, datasets and
software, including after modification or combination with other data.

Any use of this annotation must therefore carry that acknowledgement and cite:

  Pirtskhalava M. et al. DBAASP v3: database of antimicrobial/cytotoxic activity
  and structure of peptides as a resource for development of new therapeutics.
  Nucleic Acids Research, 2021. https://dbaasp.org

This annotation contains no data from AMPBench-MT or from QMAP: only DBAASP
record identifiers and DBAASP-derived fields. See README.md, "Provenance and
licensing".

